    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>The below Hazards include all Hazards likely to occur in Civilized, Interior, and Urban environments: </p><table class=\"sortable wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>KEYWORDS </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\">Saga Edition Core Rulebook </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\">Acid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Acid, Contact, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Turret\" title=\"Blaster Turret\">Blaster Turret</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Artificial, Energy </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Set_Explosive\" title=\"Set Explosive\">Set Explosive</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Detonite\" title=\"Detonite\">Detonite</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Area, Artificial, Energy </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Rifle_Turret\" title=\"Blaster Rifle Turret\">Blaster Rifle Turret</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Area, Artificial, Energy </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Set_Explosive\" title=\"Set Explosive\">Set Explosive</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Explosive_Charge\" title=\"Explosive Charge\">Explosive Charge</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 5 </td> \n   <td>Area, Artificial, Energy </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trash_Compactor\" title=\"Trash Compactor\">Trash Compactor</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 10 </td> \n   <td>Artificial, Crushing </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Madness_of_Knowledge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Madness of Knowledge\">The Madness of Knowledge</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 6 </td> \n   <td>N/A </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Crowd\" title=\"Crowd\">Crowd</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Artificial </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Malfunctioning_Blast_Door\" title=\"Malfunctioning Blast Door\">Malfunctioning Blast Door</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Artificial </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Electrified_Fence\" title=\"Electrified Fence\">Electrified Fence</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 5 </td> \n   <td>Artificial, Contact, Energy </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Speeder_Traffic\" title=\"Speeder Traffic\">Speeder Traffic</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 </td> \n   <td>Artificial </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exposed_Plasma_Conduit\" title=\"Exposed Plasma Conduit\">Exposed Plasma Conduit</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 9 </td> \n   <td>Artificial or Natural, Contact, Fire </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Production_Assembly_Line\" title=\"Production Assembly Line\">Production Assembly Line</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 12 </td> \n   <td>Artificial </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Forgotten_Minefield\" title=\"Forgotten Minefield\">Forgotten Minefield</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 13 </td> \n   <td>Area, Artificial, Contact, Energy, Fire </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dawn of Defiance\">Dawn of Defiance</a> </th>\n  